      "id": "claim_65029723b0174609a6860ee8ada5cba7",
      "statement": "Every external entry surface (cold-start CLI argument, second-instance activation payload, macOS open-file/open-url and Windows WM_DROPFILES drops) funnels into one handler, open_new_task_with_payload, which classifies the payload by content: limedl:// deep link, local .torrent/.metalink file, magnet link, or clipboard-classified single/batch URLs.",
