      "id": "claim_c90e83e63bf44326bde79ebfb879975d",
      "statement": "A single URL payload is offered to the aria2c parser before falling back to filling the URL field, so pasted commands are unpacked instead of left as unparseable text, and HTTP(S) single URLs additionally get an automatic checksum probe.",
