      "id": "claim_652d1a9436dc4d8e946842fe25fe1b67",
      "statement": "The aria2c tokenizer folds ^/backslash line continuations first, groups single- and double-quoted tokens, keeps backslashes literal outside quotes (Windows paths) while escaping only quote and backslash inside double quotes, and gates the parse on the first token's basename being aria2c plus at least one recognizable download target.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/limedl-native/src/aria2_cli.rs#L1-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6edf4a55b1ddd332660aabe7c6ee54cce7388483843ddea42a155e1c187b0b8d:"
