    {
      "id": "claim_3f5c5a90742c4346ac375cf0aceb2b03",
      "statement": "The URL field keeps the raw aria2c command text and the target, mirrors, user agent and checksum are re-derived from it at submit time; the checksum precedence is manual field (validated by parse_user_checksum, which accepts GNU/BSD formats and algo: prefixes) then parsed --checksum then the probe hash, and editing the field away from a command clears the headers and hint it had filled.",
