      "id": "claim_659456f837a4457fbbecf80b267f1ff0",
      "statement": "A single-mode dialog can start only one download, so extra targets become mirrors and a -Z request with several targets is appended to the ignored-option list; the dialog states what it parsed and what it ignored through a localized hint rather than changing the user's meaning silently.",
