      "id": "claim_0cde0e08080840bf896ae25d480f53ab",
      "statement": "Batch text is one task per non-blank, non-comment line, where a line is either a plain URL (range-expanded) or a whole aria2c command kept verbatim (quotes not stripped); entries_from_aria2 yields separate downloads under -Z or after range expansion growth and otherwise one download with the remaining targets as mirrors, and --out is kept only when the command yields exactly one task.",
